### Login — gives access token
# @name login
POST {{hostname}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "eemeli",
    "password": "eemeli"
}

### logintoken from response
@loginToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Create album (requires valid access token)
POST {{hostname}}/albums/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginToken}}

{
    "artist": "xxx2",
    "title": "xxx",
    "year": 1982,
    "genre": "Pop",
    "tracks": 10
}

### Refresh — gives new accesstoken if expired or need to refresh time
# @name refresh
POST {{hostname}}/auth/refresh

### new token from response
@refreshedToken = {{refresh.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Protected route with token
GET {{hostname}}/albums/getAllAlbums
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshedToken}}

### Logout — clears jwt cookie and refresh cookie from database
POST {{hostname}}/auth/logout

### trying refresh after logout
POST {{hostname}}/auth/refresh

### Protected route without token/logged out
GET {{hostname}}/albums/
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshedToken}}